    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Rebellion_Era_Campaign_Guide\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Rebellion Era Campaign Guide\">Star Wars Saga Edition Rebellion Era Campaign Guide</a></i></p><p><i>See also:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Feats\" title=\"Feats\">Feats</a>, <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Species_Feats\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Species Feats\">Species Feats</a></i></p><p>You have confidence in your ability to learn information that others consider secret, and in doing so, boost your confidence in other areas.</p><p><b>Prerequisite:</b> <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Bothan\" title=\"Bothan\">Bothan</a></p><p><b>Effect:</b> Whenever you successfully use the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Learn_Secret_Information\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Learn Secret Information\">Learn Secret Information</a> application of the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Gather_Information\" title=\"Gather Information\">Gather Information</a> Skill, you gain 1 <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Point\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force Point\">Force Point</a>. You cannot gain more than 3 <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Points\" title=\"Force Points\">Force Points</a> each level, and you cannot have more <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Points\" title=\"Force Points\">Force Points</a> than you gained when you reached your current level.</p>",
